  "releaseNotes": "**DI027 otherwise-unused private subscription fields** — a `Subscribe(...)` token assigned directly to a private field declared on the subscriber now reports when that field has no other symbol-bound reference across any partial declaration. Any later disposal, return, argument pass, reassignment, or other field access remains conservative and silent; inherited and externally accessible fields also stay silent because handling outside the subscriber cannot be ruled out.",
